msgstr "面向 A2A 客户端的回环 A2A 接口。"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/intro/install.rst:390
msgid "``anetlink``"
msgstr "``anetlink``"

#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v034-zcode/ANet/docs/intro/install.rst:391
msgid "Client for device capabilities provided by ANetLink."
msgstr "ANetLink 所提供设备能力的客户端。"

